# Kairos backtest quickstart

This project includes an offline deterministic example. It needs no provider
credentials or network connection.

```bash
kairos launch diagnose validate {{launch_id}}
kairos project doctor
kairos launch start {{launch_id}}
kairos launch wait {{launch_id}}
```

Generated files belong to you. Edit `{{strategy_package_path}}/strategy.py` freely;
`kairos template status` reports customization but never overwrites it.
